[b]PlanBuild: client-only blueprints[/b]

Capture buildings, load .blueprint or .vbuild files, and position a private hologram. The server and other players do not need PlanBuild.

Install BepInEx and Jötunn 2.30.0 or newer on your client. Press End in a world to open the planner. Blueprints live in BepInEx/config/PlanBuild/blueprints. Capture nearby player-built pieces or load a file, adjust its position, then close the planner and equip your hammer. With Assist hammer enabled, aim at missing hologram pieces near a surface and click. The recipe and pose are selected automatically. You must carry the materials; Valheim validates placement and consumes resources normally. Completed pieces disappear from the guide.

The old rune, Plan Hammer, totems, shared plans, terrain tools and server marketplace are no longer registered. Back up old worlds and characters, and finish or remove original plans with the original mod before upgrading.

See README.md for usage, migration and development details.
